  m_text: 'Create windows on a submarine by using a line pattern:


    1) Turn the
    main body temporarily on its side.


    2) Project a line pattern of windos
    on the side of the submarine.


    3) Turn the main body back to its default
    rotation.


    Optional: Align the windows to the surface normals like in the
    example with the spiked ball.'
