  m_text: "Create a spiked sphere using a Grid pattern projected onto a sphere:\n\n1)
    Project the spikes on a grid onto half the sphere.\n\n2) Raise the newly-created
    spikes onto a Y-position higher than the base sphere.\n\n3) Select the appropriate
    \"Alignment Layers\" for the base sphere. \n\n4) Check the \"Align to Surface
    Normal\" box.\n\n5) Click \"Align With Surface\".\n\nThis will project the spikes
    downward and align them with the surface normals of the sphere."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
