  m_text: 'Mark the spot of a hidden secret with a circle of coins:


    1) Instead
    of projecting a pattern onto a terrain itself (which are usually huge), create
    a temporary tile above your terrain (higher Y-position) to project your pattern.
    This will keep your prefabs contained to a specific area.


    2) Remove the
    temporary tile from between your created coins and the Terrain.


    3) Click
    "Align With Surface" to align your coins to the terrain.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
